Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Danilo Baltierra represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 61, "text": "**URUGUAYAN FOOTBALLER DANILO BALTIERA FINDS NEW HOME AT C.A."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 62, "end": 69, "text": "CERRO**"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 71, "end": 249, "text": "Montevideo, Uruguay - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the Uruguayan football community, Danilo Baltierra, the talented Uruguayan footballer, has officially joined C.A."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 250, "end": 315, "text": "Cerro, one of the country's most storied athletic football clubs."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 316, "end": 490, "text": "According to sources close to the club, Baltierra, who has been making waves in the football world with his impressive skills on the pitch, signed a multi-year deal with C.A."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 491, "end": 515, "text": "Cerro earlier this week."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 516, "end": 562, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Danilo to the C.A."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 563, "end": 644, "text": "Cerro family,\" said club president, Juan Carlos López, in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 645, "end": 768, "text": "\"He is an exceptional player with a bright future ahead of him, and we believe he will be a valuable addition to our team.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 769, "end": 901, "text": "Baltierra, who has been playing professionally for several years, has already made a name for himself in Uruguayan football circles."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 902, "end": 1037, "text": "His impressive stats, including 15 goals in 25 appearances for his previous club, have earned him a reputation as a formidable striker."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1038, "end": 1064, "text": "\"I am excited to join C.A."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1065, "end": 1140, "text": "Cerro and contribute to the team's success,\" Baltierra said in a statement."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1141, "end": 1255, "text": "\"I am looking forward to working with the coaching staff and my new teammates to bring championships to the club.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1256, "end": 1366, "text": "Data from Transfermarkt, a leading football statistics website, confirms that Baltierra has indeed joined C.A."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1367, "end": 1441, "text": "Cerro, with the transfer being officially registered on February 10, 2023."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1442, "end": 1446, "text": "C.A."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1447, "end": 1632, "text": "Cerro, founded in 1922, has a rich history in Uruguayan football, having won several national championships and participating in international tournaments such as the Copa Libertadores."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1633, "end": 1787, "text": "With Baltierra on board, the club is expected to make a strong push for the top spot in the Uruguayan Primera División, the country's top football league."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1788, "end": 1840, "text": "\"Danilo's signing is a major coup for us,\" said C.A."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1841, "end": 1870, "text": "Cerro coach, Gustavo Matosas."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1871, "end": 1968, "text": "\"He brings a level of skill and experience that will undoubtedly elevate our team's performance.\""}, "D1S