!\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 913, "end": 982, "text": "Danilo's eyes sparkled as she took her place alongside her teammates."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 983, "end": 1106, "text": "She had always thrived under pressure, and the thought of outsmarting their opponents' defenses was a tantalizing prospect."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1107, "end": 1218, "text": "As the drills began, she lost herself in the rhythm of the game, her feet moving in perfect sync with the ball."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1219, "end": 1340, "text": "It was a moment like this, surrounded by the camaraderie and competition of her teammates, that Danilo felt most at home."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1341, "end": 1464, "text": "She had traveled far from her Uruguayan roots to join the Blues, but it was a decision she would make again in a heartbeat."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1465, "end": 1503, "text": "For in the blue jersey of Chelsea F.C."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1504, "end": 1624, "text": "Women, she had found a sense of belonging, a sense of purpose, and a sense of pride that she wore like a badge of honor."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1625, "end": 1774, "text": "As the training session drew to a close, Danilo gathered her gear and made her way to the locker room, already mentally preparing for the next match."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1775, "end": 1890, "text": "She knew that in the world of women's football, every game was a battle, every opponent a challenge to be overcome."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1891, "end": 1951, "text": "But with her skills, her determination, and her Chelsea F.C."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Danilo Ba